Vibe Fortress

The npm package "vibefortress" bundles open-source JavaScript packages. Their names, versions and licence texts are in
dist/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt inside the package.

Local scanners are downloaded on first use, never bundled, and verified against the SHA-256 values pinned in dist/scanners.lock.json:
- gitleaks (MIT) https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks
- OSV-Scanner (Apache-2.0) https://github.com/google/osv-scanner, vulnerability data from https://osv.dev
- Opengrep (LGPL-2.1) https://github.com/opengrep/opengrep, run with Vibe Fortress's own rules.

The hosted Vibe Fortress service is built on Google Mantis (https://github.com/google/mantis, Apache-2.0). No Mantis code is part of
this repository or of the npm package.
